%%text Solar Carol
%%text (Adam Austill, Court Dorsey, Charlie King, Marcia Taylor) 
%%text See the sun how bright it shines, on the nations of the earth 
%%text All who share this thing called life celebrate each day's rebirth 
%%text (cho) So-o-o-o-lar power, inexpensive energy (2x) 
%%text Brother river can you hear how the valley calls you down 
%%text Send your rushing waters near, let the joyful hills resound 
%%text Sister wind we've heard on high sweetly singing o'er the plain 
%%text And the windmills in reply echoing their glad refrain 
%%text How we love complexity when the answer's rather plain 
%%text Join the sun in jubilee, sing with us this joyous strain 

